=== E2.2: Appendix A Scaled Hyperbolic Tangent f(a) = 1.7159 tanh(2/3 a) (Eq. 6 & p. 41) ===
  f(+1.0) = +0.999997, f(-1.0) = -0.999997 (|f(1) - 1| = 2.74e-06)
